{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hi! Since we last spoke I am still working on the dance studio and things are looking up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-51b007015d5174191b5059a1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:19.921679+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "51b007015d5174191b5059a1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "51b007015d5174191b5059a1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hi! You're so inspiring taking it on and opening your own studio!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-de4835c5e8b7135c9f9a7810", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:19.952430+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "de4835c5e8b7135c9f9a7810", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "de4835c5e8b7135c9f9a7810", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Losing my job gave me the push to finally start my dream business: my own dance studio! Now I'm stepping into the unknown and hoping for the best."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-228b3741315cc69607955973", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:19.975734+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "228b3741315cc69607955973", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "228b3741315cc69607955973", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: It must be scary stepping into the unknown but I know you can do it, Jon. With your determination and drive, your dance studio will be a huge success. Keep that positive outlook and keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-5ca78b5487763dd1e46c3e37", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.005687+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5ca78b5487763dd1e46c3e37", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5ca78b5487763dd1e46c3e37", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! It's a bit scary, but I just think about my love for dance and how it makes me feel. It's been my stress-buster since childhood!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-b74e5a0ee6a9b14dbe4126bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.028606+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b74e5a0ee6a9b14dbe4126bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b74e5a0ee6a9b14dbe4126bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Gotcha, Jon! Dance is my stress fix too. As soon as I start, all my worries vanish. It's amazing what we can do for our own mental health with something we enjoy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-6873f57145b3424977be3b06", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.050588+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6873f57145b3424977be3b06", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6873f57145b3424977be3b06", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Yeah, Gina! Dancing helps me de-stress. It's where I'm most alive. It's a must-have in my life."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-9b413ab1b955a925c7e3c1d7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.070574+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9b413ab1b955a925c7e3c1d7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9b413ab1b955a925c7e3c1d7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: I get it, Jon. Dance is just me -- I can't picture life without it. It's like air."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-9105e6155a051b5af0fb7bdf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.087600+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9105e6155a051b5af0fb7bdf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9105e6155a051b5af0fb7bdf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Yep! Dancing is like second nature to me. I'm living my dream by having my own dance studio and teaching others."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-0ea0f1d8fc57d3fdb3f802da", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.104703+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0ea0f1d8fc57d3fdb3f802da", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0ea0f1d8fc57d3fdb3f802da", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: You're living the dream and inspiring others too! Your studio will totally change things for lots of folks."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-ea840f232956688802411873", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.123515+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ea840f232956688802411873", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ea840f232956688802411873", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I hope so, Gina. I want to create a place for people to dance and express themselves - it's been a dream of mine."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-4c5d37e2219218914aed7dce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.141446+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c5d37e2219218914aed7dce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c5d37e2219218914aed7dce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: That's a great dream, Jon! Giving people a place to express themselves with dance is really important. Your studio is gonna make a huge difference. Can't wait to see it happen!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-ddfb113f7ba2b55dbb91c17a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.156450+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ddfb113f7ba2b55dbb91c17a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ddfb113f7ba2b55dbb91c17a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Your help means a lot. Keep you posted on the dance studio progress."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-f30cfe445aa397e86b3887f2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.175847+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f30cfe445aa397e86b3887f2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f30cfe445aa397e86b3887f2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks! Really appreciate you keeping me in the loop on this cool project. Can't wait to hear more and watch it come to life! Oh, btw, I had an interview for a design internship yesterday! It was so cool."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-fb1a681caafd59ca685703e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.184847+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fb1a681caafd59ca685703e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fb1a681caafd59ca685703e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Wow, Gina, I'm stoked about this! Taking a risk is scary, but I'm sure following my dreams will pay off in the end. How did the interview go?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-c6a22b52c8cf47e1c518dd28", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.211138+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c6a22b52c8cf47e1c518dd28", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c6a22b52c8cf47e1c518dd28", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: It was great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-23475ae2fb207552a245230a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.231647+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "23475ae2fb207552a245230a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "23475ae2fb207552a245230a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Glad to hear it. Been practicing dance routines lately, it keeps my mind focused and motivated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-3ebbace9bf7650f266c35e26", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.246580+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3ebbace9bf7650f266c35e26", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3ebbace9bf7650f266c35e26", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow! That's great. Dancing is awesome for staying focused. Wanna show me a routine sometime?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-a1bc5f6273094ac6bf5f0fc9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.265577+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a1bc5f6273094ac6bf5f0fc9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a1bc5f6273094ac6bf5f0fc9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Sure, Gina! Wanna see one of my routines? Lemme know when you got time and I'll send you a vid."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-acc426832a0b8021772e16a2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.284825+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "acc426832a0b8021772e16a2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "acc426832a0b8021772e16a2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yeah, Jon, I'll watch your routine! So proud of you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-e9ee5164e8f6bcfc556b097c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.302773+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e9ee5164e8f6bcfc556b097c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e9ee5164e8f6bcfc556b097c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks a lot! Your help really means a lot. I'll get the video to you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-ea0e87439345577ab2557b01", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.320596+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ea0e87439345577ab2557b01", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ea0e87439345577ab2557b01", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: No prob! Always here to help. Can't wait to see the vid!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_11-40b73c4ee1522866d33a9c89", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:28:20.338661+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "40b73c4ee1522866d33a9c89", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "40b73c4ee1522866d33a9c89", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
